V8: "[scopes] Fix private name resolution in catch scopes and heritage eval"
(crbug 576949678, not public; no CVE listed yet): private name lookup could
fail to skip an inner class's ClassScope when evaluated inside the class's
extends heritage clause (via lazily compiled catch scopes or direct eval).
V8 main commit cd24b54657af525b1cd3030d750d0db798b96e1f, merged on
2026-11-03 to 15.7 (d64b6ea4f9cafb809c39838d75c187f6e50dbbc7, for 157; not
yet rolled into the 157 branch) and to 15.6. This is the 15.7 merge, at v8/,
without its tests. Drop it once a 157 tag's V8 has it.

